          "answer": "хочу",
          "wordBank": ["хочу", "хочет", "хотят", "хотел"],
          "explanation": "\"Я хочу\" — I want (я form). Polite alternative: \"Я бы хотел\" — I would like."
        },
        {
          "type": "listening",
          "text": "Что вы порекомендуете?",
          "options": ["What do you recommend?", "What did you order?", "Where is the menu?", "Is the soup hot?"],
